ior":"TIMEOUT_BEHAVIOR_BACKGROUND","hardTimeout":86400000,"description":"View GitHub issue #10","closeStdin":true,"conversationId":"9fe30b80-d334-4ff0-ad00-19ff619b32c9","adminCommandDenylist":[],"requestId":"46fec545-9cff-4ca8-a876-d8b6b8772553"},"result":{"success":{"command":"gh issue view 10 --repo \"$(git -C /Users/user/work/delegate-fixtures remote get-url origin 2>/dev/null | sed 's/.*github.com[:/]\\(.*\\)\\.git/\\1/')\" 2>/dev/null || gh issue view 10","workingDirectory":"","exitCode":0,"signal":"","stdout":"title:\tresume (with overrides) and cancel\nstate:\tOPEN\nauthor:\tuser (Amogh Akshintala)\nlabels:\tready-for-agent\ncomments:\t0\nassignees:\t\nprojects:\t\nmilestone:\t\nissue-type:\t\nparent:\t\nsub-issues:\t\nsub-issues-completed:\t\nblocked-by:\tuser/delegate#7\nblocking:\tuser/delegate#12\nnumber:\t10\n--\n## Parent\n\n#4\n\n## What to build\n\n- `delegate resume <jobId> [--model M] [--capability C] [--gate CMD]`, prompt on stdin or `--prompt-file`. Reads the job's status record, reuses its model, cwd, capability, gate and tool-idle window, applies overrides, and starts a new job continuing the backend session. Works on any terminal status. A model override on a different backend is rejected. Returns a new job id.\n- `delegate cancel <jobId>`: reads the supervisor pid from the record, signals its process group, and the record ends CANCELLED.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- [ ] Resume continues the session (the fake agent sees the resume flag and session id) with the original settings.\n- [ ] Each override replaces its stored value; a cross-backend model is rejected.\n- [ ] Resume works when the original `run` and supervisor processes are gone.\n- [ ] Cancel stops the agent and every process it started; the record says CANCELLED.\n- [ ] End-to-end tests cover each case.\n\n## Blocked by\n\n- #7 Tracer: delegate run + supervisor + watch on cursor\n","stderr":"","executionTime":2216,"interleavedOutput":"title:\tresume (with overrides) and cancel\nstate:\tOPEN\nauthor:\tuser (Amogh Akshintala)\nlabels:\tready-for-agent\ncomments:\t0\nassignees:\t\nprojects:\t\nmilestone:\t\nissue-type:\t\nparent:\t\nsub-issues:\t\nsub-issues-completed:\t\nblocked-by:\tuser/delegate#7\nblocking:\tuser/delegate#12\nnumber:\t10\n--\n## Parent\n\n#4\n\n## What to build\n\n- `delegate resume <jobId> [--model M] [--capability C] [--gate CMD]`, prompt on stdin or `--prompt-file`. Reads the job's status record, reuses its model, cwd, capability, gate and tool-idle window, applies overrides, and starts a new job continuing the backend session. Works on any terminal status. A model override on a different backend is rejected. Returns a new job id.\n- `delegate cancel <jobId>`: reads the supervisor pid from the record, signals its process group, and the record ends CANCELLED.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- [ ] Resume continues the session (the fake agent sees the resume flag and session id) with the original settings.\n- [ ] Each override replaces its stored value; a cross-backend model is rejected.\n- [ ] Resume works when the original `run` and supervisor processes are gone.\n- [ ] Cancel stops the agent and every process it started; the record says CANCELLED.\n- [ ] End-to-end tests cover each case.\n\n## Blocked by\n\n- #7 Tracer: delegate run + supervisor + watch on cursor\n","localExecutionTimeMs":1534},"isBackground":false},"description":"View GitHub issue #10"},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"tool_0e4930d6-d67b-4657-a83b-3e774f8e0d1","startedAtMs":"1790844176732","completedAtMs":"1790844179013"},"model_call_id":"46fec545-9cff-4ca8-a876-d8b6b8772553-0-4oo8","session_id":"9fe30b80-d334-4ff0-ad00-19ff619b32c9","timestamp_ms":1790844178952}
